  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Mapping landscapes in C&#xf4;te d&apos;Ivoire</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NLRC 510 to support CRCI in analysing landscapes: identifying (potential) benefits, ecosystems and their requirements, interconnections between ecosystems, and potential threats to, and vulnerabilities of, ecosystems and biotopes
- Mapping and monitoring of relevant areas with a special emphasis on lakes and reservoirs, gold mining, remnants of tropical rain forest, rivers and streams, areas with tree monocultures.</narrative>
  </description>
